Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:29.24,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fn@FZShuTi-S05\fs30\frz270\c&H354680&\3c&H81ADD9&\bord3\pos(247.348,224.578)}志太\N愿你能做一个无愧于孩子的父亲
